{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEED</strong> is a puzzle platformer built around planning and execution where each level happens in two phases:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1 \u2013 Record</strong> <br>Record a path though an empty level to guide the seed safely to the end of the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 2 \u2013 Execute</strong> <br>Witness the seed execute the path you recorded, in the same level, now full of traps. And see if it survives...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.poster.avif?t=1772563141\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.webm?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/0088d2eee8ee032b0ea51f2d7c3367db.mp4?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ee6b133af99ab81f6fc6cbb5b48bdaf3.webp?t=1772563141\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Success won\u2019t come on your first try. Learn from each mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route as levels grow increasingly complex with new traps and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.poster.avif?t=1772563141\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.webm?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/415e67620d403c9535490f4e41f7e770.mp4?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3a38e273cef9658158d2d822fb9a9b47.webp?t=1772563141\" width=616 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect golden seeds throughout the levels to unlock special missions and discover unique gameplay twists that will put your skills to test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.poster.avif?t=1772563141\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.webm?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/61e131cd56faa5db942d287e8ff4f5c4.mp4?t=1772563141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/c05e175dde6f2cee71280c38279d24c2.webp?t=1772563141\" width=616 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue every seed and bring them back to your ship to complete your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extra